ex/sessions/2026/07/15/rollout-2026-07-15T15-22-01-019f65f1-0246-7c83-9c24-dd45127a4929.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-15T13:44:33+00:00, thread_id=019f65f1-0246-7c83-9c24-dd45127a4929, same rollout; distinct routing value for compile/verification and conditional-closeout guidance)\n1457-\n--\n1494-- symptom: `technical.tex` fails on the first compile with an undefined macro -> cause: required math macros such as `\\\\cR` were not defined in the draft preamble -> fix: define custom macros before the first compile and rerun immediately on the exact error [Task 2]\n1495:- symptom: first-pass LaTeX warnings look like unresolved problems at closeout -> cause: references only settle after a second pass -> fix: rerun `pdflatex` and report final-state warnings separately from first-pass noise [Task 2]\n1496-- symptom: visual PDF inspection cannot be completed through the sandboxed image viewer -> cause: rendered PNG paths could not be reopened in this environment -> fix: treat `pdfinfo` plus successful PDF generation as the verified fallback and state that visual inspection remained partial [Task 2]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
